    328,
    169
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "(2) By deducting 12 Rasis from Dhooma we get Vyatipata.",
   "bbox": [
    121,
    178,
    450,
    194
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "(3) Add 6 Rasis to the longitude of Vyatipata, we will get Partvesha.",
   "bbox": [
    121,
    202,
    502,
    218
   ]
  },
