  {
   "text": "6. The first house gets one Rupa of strength if it is a triped sign. If it be ",
   "bbox": [
    121,
    542,
    556,
    558
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "Vrischika it gets 1 /4 Rupa as its strength. In any other sign the strength will be 1/2 ",
   "bbox": [
    85,
    567,
    556,
    582
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "Rupa.",
   "bbox": [
    85,
    591,
    118,
    606
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "The strength of the Ascendant (Lagna) is equal to that of its Lord and is very ",
   "bbox": [
    121,
    615,
    556,
    630
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "powerful when the lord occupies an Upachaya house (3, 6, 10, 11). It is also very ",
   "bbox": [
    85,
    639,
    556,
    654
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "powerful when it .is aspected by its lord Jupiter or Mercury or when it is occupied ",
   "bbox": [
    85,
    663,
    556,
    679
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "by Venus and is at the same time without the conjunction or aspect of any other ",
   "bbox": [
